OL,3,GNEWSAThames Water reports seven-borough
OL,4,Awater outage
OL,5,
OL,6,FHomes across five south London boroughs
OL,7,Fand two Surrey boroughs may have no
OL,8,Fwater or low pressure, Thames Water has
OL,9,Fsaid.
OL,11,FThe company said it was "aware of an
OL,12,Fissue" affecting customers in postcode
OL,13,Fareas across Kingston upon Thames,
OL,14,FMerton, Richmond upon Thames, Sutton
OL,15,Fand Wandsworth in London, as well as
OL,16,FElmbridge and Spelthorne in Surrey.
OL,18,FA Thames Water spokesperson apologised
OL,19,Ffor the lack of water, adding: "Our
OL,20,Fengineers have located the leak and are
OL,21,Fdoing everything they can to ensure
OL,22,Fwater is back on as soon as possible."
